#figure-9 option 1: svg 2,169,292 B, pdf 1 page 481.9 x 265.0 pt, errors []
  export caption: Raw log2 FC of 11,739 genes tested in both: Spearman rho = 0.57; the line is x = y. 31 individuals are in both contrasts, so the two estimates are not independent. Over the 672 genes called in either, rho = 0.73.
  svg caption: Raw log2 FC of 11,739 genes tested in both: Spearman rho = 0.57; the line is x = y. 31 individuals are in both contrasts, so the two estimates are not independent. Over the 672 genes called in either, rho = 0.73. This view shows Agreement of the calls; the figure files and the reading guide show Called in either. Drawn in the browser from the view as set on the page, at the figure files' width.
